WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.396
Use the boiling-pot analogy. Conduction transfers heat through contact, such as

00:00:04.396 --> 00:00:08.442
through the pot and its handle. The solid material does not

00:00:08.442 --> 00:00:08.810
circulate.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.608
Convection carries heat with moving material. Warm water rises, spreads, cools,

00:00:14.608 --> 00:00:18.866
and sinks. Follow a parcel around the cell, just as in

00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:19.640
his review.

00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:25.464
Radiation carries energy as electromagnetic waves. Then connect the mechanisms to

00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:30.452
geology: rising mantle carries heat, and hot magma can conduct heat

00:00:30.452 --> 00:00:31.813
into neighboring crust.
